This product includes code adapted from the opencode project
(https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode), MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2025
opencode. Adapted modules carry an "// Adapted from opencode (MIT)" header
listing their source file. The algorithms ported include content paging
(read-filesystem.ts), exact-match editing with line-ending preservation
(edit.ts), fuzzy did-you-mean suggestions (read.ts), ripgrep execution
(ripgrep.ts), path resolution/containment (file-access.ts, fs-util.ts), and
BOM-preserving writes (file-write.ts).

MIT license text: see LICENSE.

ripgrep is an optional external dependency used from the user's PATH when
available (MIT, https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep). cowork-mcp never
downloads anything at runtime.
